{"v":4,"catch":"今天玩","desc":"Classic Pool\nClassic Pool 是一款精彩刺激的台球遊戲，讓您可以在傳統的台球遊戲中測試自己的技能並提高技能。您有多個 AI 對手可供選擇，許多不同的提示和表格，以及 2 名玩家的完整多人遊戲。該遊戲還配備了手提模式、TV模式及桌上模式。如果您喜歡台球遊戲並想與朋友或 AI 測試您的實力，那麼今天就來看看吧！\n特徵：\n- 多人遊戲或對抗人工智能\n- 支援手提模式、TV模式及桌上模式\n- 多個表和提示","publisher":"Revulo Games","release":"2021-07-29","genres":["運動","模擬","桌上遊戲","訓練"],"players":"單機 1–2 人","langs":["日文","英文","西班牙文","法文","德文","韓文","中文 (簡體字)","中文 (繁體字)"],"pmax":2,"poff":2,"rating":"NONE","size":"Switch 2 0.5GB / Switch 0.5GB","modes":["TV 模式","桌上模式","手提模式"],"shots":["https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/23d9fd2a2f7ac14a4822ef20ec3de5ef7dda781f296f7bff53a02db1eb955a8b.jpg","https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/354dec54d824aa299a93503769c23dc3f75c427a319b8fd701f2a8e9d3759164.jpg","https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/1e7c42c550abb4d5218d3e35cea0790c5c1d468ebfdbe2b50f1cadcbe877eb63.jpg","https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/405ed2992699839e4f04dde017982e04c6544123799fe5c53db3f8e6ce7a4e9c.jpg","https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/a765a36b00bf563cdee03bf2e7b26eb94c8bdf9d0205277ec956e52d57c62411.jpg","https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/3b753159631857961542bb5c83db2fc6c29951260d07b59ef8ae072077315fd8.jpg"],"titleId":"01006740157f8000","dlc":[]}